  "question": {
    "text": "A hydrogen atom is in the ground state. Then to get six lines in the emission spectrum, the wavelength of incident radiation should be ( Rydberg constant&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)",
